sequenceDiagram
    participant State as Previous state x[k-1]
    participant Control as Speed + heading u[k]
    participant Model as State transition
    participant Sigma as Sigma points
    participant Cov as Covariance P[k-1]
    participant GPS as GPS measurement
    participant Kalman as UKF update
    participant Out as E/N output

    State->>Model: propagate with control input
    Control->>Model: speed and heading
    Cov->>Sigma: generate sigma-point spread
    Sigma->>Model: predict candidate states
    Model->>Kalman: predicted mean / covariance
    GPS->>Kalman: measurement correction
    Kalman->>Out: corrected position + velocity
    Out->>Out: save FIT fields / UI values
